OL,3,GNEWSAWhat is Clare's Law and how can it
OL,4,Aprotect your family and friends?
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne woman is killed every five days by
OL,7,Fan abusive partner in England and
OL,8,FWales, as millions of others remain in
OL,9,Fviolent relationships.
OL,11,FFor friends and family who feel at a
OL,12,Floss of knowing how to help when they
OL,13,Fsuspect a loved one is at risk, there
OL,14,Fis a way of applying for support from
OL,15,Fpolice that lots of people are still
OL,16,Funaware exists.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
