OL,3,GNEWSAWhat is Clare's Law and how can it
OL,4,Aprotect your family and friends?
OL,5,
OL,6,FKnown as Clare's Law, the family who
OL,7,Fcampaigned for the legislation to be
OL,8,Fintroduced after Clare Wood was
OL,9,Fmurdered by her partner are speaking
OL,10,Fout, saying that more than a decade on,
OL,11,Fthere is still little awareness of the
OL,12,Flife-changing scheme.
OL,14,FIt allows people to request information
OL,15,Ffrom police to show whether a current
OL,16,For former partner has a history of
OL,17,Fabusive or violent behaviour.
